    "created_at": "2022-09-13T18:59:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-09-13T18:59:20Z",
    "body": "> The selection is working _only_ if the selection starts outside of the button.\r\n\r\nAnd I think that is rather weird behavior. One may select the text, but clearing the selection doesn't work the normal way by just clicking the selection. One has to click outside the button. That is at least the behavior in Chrome. ",
