    "body": "Note the [css-ui spec includes](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui/#issue-5d851d49) (just before the inline issue) the following:\r\n\r\n> The following additions are made to the UA stylesheet for HTML:\r\n>\r\n> ```css\r\n> button, meter, progress, select { user-select: none; }\r\n> ```",
