    "created_at": "2024-04-08T07:32:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-04-08T07:32:43Z",
    "body": "The way I would expect this to be sliced:\r\n\r\n* We don't have `user-select:none` by default and note that `user-select` is not a property that is honored for `appearance:auto` widgets. (This might need some specification effort.)\r\n* Implementation can decide whether they want their `appearance:auto` widgets to be selectable or not. It should generally be up to them how `appearance:auto` widgets behave after all.\r\n* Ideally they make those choices consistently across similar widgets.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
