    "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:25:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-23T13:29:00Z",
    "body": "Having come across this again I think it would be good get some movement on it. I think Anne raises a good point that this doesn't need to be specified for appearance:auto they are after all up to the browser to decide on what to do.\n\nIf that's the case it would be good to get movement on fixing this. Given Chromium and WebKit both have unusual text selection on `<button>` already it would seem to make sense to align with input buttons and just make it none?\n\nThough at least in WebKit that might have accessibility issues? https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/10017\n\nEither way I think we should try to resolve the inconsistency personally.",
